docs {
POST /api/v1/voice/token - mint JWT LiveKit voice room global.

Wajib Bearer + header X-Device-Id (8-64). Device id disimpan di
metadata participant LiveKit. Jika identity (user) sudah di room dari
device lain → 409 VOICE_ALREADY_JOINED. Remint device yang sama OK
(refresh/reconnect). Room penuh → 409 VOICE_ROOM_FULL. Flag off → 403.
}

meta {
  name: Mint Voice Token
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/voice/token
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

headers {
  X-Device-Id: {{device_id}}
}

tests {
  test("200 + token/url/room", () => {
    expect(res.status).to.equal(200);
    expect(res.body.success).to.equal(true);
    expect(res.body.data.token).to.be.a("string").and.not.empty;
    expect(res.body.data.url).to.be.a("string").and.not.empty;
    expect(res.body.data.room).to.be.a("string").and.not.empty;
    expect(res.body.data.maxParticipants).to.be.a("number");
  });
}
